49348b750986ee10102cd5c3ef1fdadc4d53cd59533834d448462916cf3d689ff561c3e54adafae570a2c4e6fde49589a2e3aa74e4eb9f14e29f79434196f617  0002-allow-tests-without-cli-docs-feature.patch
